/E (An Arithmetic Logic Unit \(ALU\) is one of the main building blocks of a digital system. It is used in processors, controllers, and embedded systems to perform arithmetic and logical calculations. The ALU is responsible for executing operations such as addition, subtraction, comparison, shifting, and bitwise logic functions.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [0]
>>
