253 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 117 0 R
/E (In this project, a parameterized ALU was designed and verified using Verilog HDL. The design allows the operand size to be changed through parameters, which makes the ALU flexible and reusable for different applications. In this implementation, the default data width used is 8 bits.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
