/Title (To verify the design, a self-checking Verilog testbench was developed. The testbench automatically compares the ALU outputs with expected results generated from a reference model. Different test cases such as normal operations, boundary conditions, invalid inputs, signed operations, and pipeline operations were simulated to ensure correct functionality of the design.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1128 0 R
